        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Exceptional 3 bedroom A rated home located in new development just off the Termonfeckin road. Presented in showhouse condition, this home is ready to walk in to. Recently upgraded by current owners to include features such as PV solar panels and battery, full astro turf rear garden with large timber garden room, to name but a few. These cleverly designed homes enjoy accommodation over 3 floors which briefly comprises of kitchen, living room, downstairs toilet, utility room, 3 bedrooms, 2 of which are ensuite, family bathroom and large study, ideal for remote working. \r\nThe owners have also wired 4 rooms with CAT6 cables to insure reliable internet access. \r\n\r\nNewtown wood is ideally located close to choice of second level schools and also Drogheda Educate Together primary school. Easy access to town center and an important feature is the current construction of the new link road from Termonfeckin road which when complete will give direct access to M.1. \r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: 1.97 x 5.5\r\nLaminate wood floor, cloakroom\r\nDownstairs toilet: 1.45 x 1.58\r\nwc, whb, tiled floor\r\nKitchen; 2.77 x 4.46\r\nFitted units, integrated cooker, hob, dishwasher, fridge-freezer, LED spotlights\r\nSitting room: 4.89 x 3.37\r\nLaminate wood floor, ffrench doors to garden\r\nUtility room: 1.57 x 1.23\r\nplumbed for wm, solar battery storage\r\n1st Floor:\r\nBedroom 1: 4.3 x 3.6\r\nBuilt in wardrobes\r\nEnsuite: double shower, wc, whb, tiled floor & shower area\r\nBedroom 2: 3.69 x 2.81\r\nBathroom: 2.19 x 2.74\r\nBath, wc, whb, tiled floor and bath area, storage press\r\nHotpress: heatpump/hot water tank\r\n2nd floor:\r\nBedroom 3: 4.79 x 4.04\r\nBuilt in wardrobe\r\nEnsuite: 1.22 x 2.79\r\nShower, wc, whb, tiled floor & shower area\r\nStudy: 3.84 x 3.16\r\n\r\nExternal:\r\n1. Composite decking \r\n2. Full astro turf lawn area\r\n3. High quality timber and glazed garden room with power supply (5.58 x 3.64)\r\n4. Drains & cable ducting in rear garden\r\n5. South facing rear garden\r\n6. Side gate and access\r\n\r\nOther features:\r\n1. 15 PV solar panels with 5.6 kw battery\r\n2. Air to water heat pump\r\n3. CCTV and smart doorbell\r\n4. 4 rooms wired for CAT6e\r\n5. Water softener with drinking filter\r\n6. Pre-wired to front for PV car charger"
      },
